{"id":4092,"chapter_id":4,"scene_id":409,"steps":[{"step":1,"speaker":"黑帮追兵","content":"结晶的力量涌出来了，这就是遗产！你们和军团全都不值一提，哈哈哈哈哈！","voice":["vo_cgplot_4092001"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_04","style":1,"background":404,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"黑帮追兵","content":"再也不用看人眼色！辛迪加是我的了！哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！","voice":["vo_cgplot_4092002"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_04","style":1,"background":404,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"content":"他们手中的狂厄结晶开始燃烧，石坛上的纹路蔓延开来，巨大的心跳声撼动整个地窟。","style":3,"background":404,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"海拉","content":"……好难受，脑子里有好多声音……呜……闭嘴，闭嘴……","voice":["vo_cgplot_4092004"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_04","style":1,"background":404,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"终止行动，离开这里……遗产在穿透枷锁，局长会被——","voice":["vo_cgplot_4092005"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_04","style":1,"background":404,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"content":"你的头开始剧痛，恍惚间那些黑帮竟如潮水般向石坛涌去。","style":3,"background":404,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"content":"而那石坛，有什么东西——有谁在……","style":3,"background":404,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"options":["不阻止它的话——"],"jump":[9],"style":6,"background":404,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"？？","content":"我来……阻止……","voice":["vo_cgplot_4092009"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_04","style":1,"background":404,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"content":"寒意突然袭来。在你身侧，一团黑影一跃而起，砸向混乱的中心。巨斧横扫，漆黑的风刃将前排的数人一同撕碎。","style":3,"background":405,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"speaker":"海拉","content":"赫罗？！你——","voice":["vo_cgplot_4092011"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_04","style":1,"background":405,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"呼……………………","voice":["vo_cgplot_4092012"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_04","style":1,"background":405,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"就凭你们……你们这种混蛋，也想妨碍军团…………","voice":["vo_cgplot_4092013"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_04","style":1,"background":405,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"我不会让你得逞的，有我在……绝不会让她倒下！","voice":["vo_cgplot_4092014"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_04","style":1,"background":405,"log_type":1}]}